flowchart LR
  BIM[IFC Building Model] --> IFC[IFC Parser / Metadata Extraction]
  IFC --> DB[(PostgreSQL)]
  SIM[Sensor / Simulator] -->|MQTT publish| BROKER[Mosquitto MQTT Broker]
  BROKER -->|MQTT subscribe| CONSUMER[Python MQTT Consumer]
  CONSUMER -->|Resolve device + channel; persist reading| DB
  WEB[React + TypeScript Web Client] <-->|HTTP REST| API[FastAPI Backend]
  API <-->|SQLAlchemy| DB
  WEB <-->|IFC model interaction| IFCVIEW[Browser IFC Viewer]
  API -->|MQTT actuator command| BROKER
  ACT[Actuator Visualiser] <-->|WebSocket live state| API
